### LogiTrans Express — ms-auth (puerto 8001)
@base = http://localhost:8001
@token = 15718855e7bfb5f5f7c9b6c27e833ba1adbe17ff34125ae64225e61676aea91a

### 1. Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jnjimenez@logitrans.com",
  "password": "password"
}

### 2. Validar token
GET {{base}}/auth/validate
Authorization: {{token}}

### 3. Logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: {{token}}

### 4. Listar usuarios
GET {{base}}/usuarios
Authorization: {{token}}

### 5. Crear usuario
POST {{base}}/usuarios
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Operador Uno",
  "email": "operador@logitrans.com",
  "password": "pass123",
  "rol": "operador"
}